# Audit (pack self-audit)

On **audit**, **full scan**, **check everything**, **find problems**, or a repeated **still broken** / **anything else** in this repo (canonical trigger list — see **`audit-protocol.mdc`**):

1. **`run_audit.cmd`** — `run_audit_tests.bat` + machine checks + sync verify; never `-SkipTests`.
2. Read **`docs/.audit_agent_manifest.json`** — complete semantic report for all required sections.
3. Edit **`docs/.audit_semantic_report.json`**; run **`scripts\verify_semantic_audit.cmd`**.
4. **`scripts\finalize_audit.cmd`** when semantic is complete.
5. Report **only** Fix and Improve.

Do not claim audit complete unless **`finalize_audit.cmd`** exits 0.

For **audit-system file edits** (not a full self-audit): `pack\scripts\sync-audit-system.ps1` then `verify-audit-system.ps1` exit 0.
